      "snippet": "IVTC is the only South Indian restaurant at Big Bay, but unfortunately, the food quality is extremely disappointing. I tried the idli, dosa, and vada, and everything was bad, including the chutney and sambar. Even the tea was horrible.\n\nBig Bay management should seriously reconsider having IVTC as its only South Indian food outlet and replace it with a better restaurant that can serve authentic, tasty South Indian food. Customers deserve much better quality and a more satisfying dining experience.",
      "extracted_snippet": {
        "original": "IVTC is the only South Indian restaurant at Big Bay, but unfortunately, the food quality is extremely disappointing. I tried the idli, dosa, and vada, and everything was bad, including the chutney and sambar. Even the tea was horrible.\n\nBig Bay management should seriously reconsider having IVTC as its only South Indian food outlet and replace it with a better restaurant that can serve authentic, tasty South Indian food. Customers deserve much better quality and a more satisfying dining experience."
      },
