      "snippet": "Hands down one of the best highway pitstops along NH 44! Big Bay is massive, clean, and ridiculously well-thought-out. Having so many food options under one roof makes it super convenient when everyone in the car wants something different.\n​What really stands out are the ultra-clean, air-conditioned restrooms and the ample parking space. Whether you're pulling over for a quick coffee break, lunch with family, or charging your EV, this place covers all the bases. The kids' area and fuel station right on-site make it a seamless one-stop pause before hitting the road again. A must-visit stop on the Bengaluru–Hyderabad route!",
